    11	// The declaration inputs a closure is resolved from are read in the window
    12	// before the manager-home lock, and the commands that rewrite them take none of
    13	// this run's locks:
    14	//
    15	//   - `curator add|remove` rewrites the project Skillfile through
    16	//     manifest.AddDecl / manifest.RemoveDecl.
    17	//   - `curator global add|remove` rewrites the machine-wide Skillfile the same
    18	//     way; living under GlobalRoot(home) does not serialize it against the
    19	//     global operation lock, because that writer never takes it.
    20	//   - Skillfile.dev.json has no Curator writer at all and is edited by hand.
    21	//
    22	// Every case below mutates one of those inputs through its real writer at
    23	// exactly the pre-home-lock boundary — OnStaged fires after every private build
    24	// succeeded and before the serialized commit phase acquires the home lock — and
    25	// requires the operation to restart closure resolution instead of committing
    26	// the declarations it planned against.
